@title 3D Heat strip and line plot show the short (estimate) tag for a catalogue enclosure
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# PR #1866. Fixture cabinet-cooling-spec-catalogue.novo has a catalogue enclosure record, so the run carries the estimate notice: the Heat strip shows "(estimate)" next to Heat and the plot along a line shows it too; the sentence itself is behind the "?".
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-cooling-spec-catalogue.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 30
click_text Heat #1
wait 20
try click_text Cancel
wait_s 5
try click_text Auto #1
wait 10
wait 30
try click_text Cancel
wait 30
try click_text Cancel
wait 20
click_text "Settings for the next run"
wait 10
click_text Quick
wait_s 3
click_text Simulate #2
wait_s 120
expect "(estimate)"
click_text Probe
wait 10
click_text Line
wait 20
expect "Pick two points"
expect "(estimate)"
shot estimate-tag
check_layout
